# Play test of The Aqueduct (CIPlay the_aqueduct, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The harbour's quay at 86-95 22 (1.6 m), the city gate at 81 22, the road up (78 24 > 55 38 > 38 30) to the square round
# the fountain at 22 22 (16 m); the spring house x -24..-15, z -17..-11 (18 m, its door east at z -17..-14) and the path up
# from the west beach (-55 -5 > -30 -28 > -23 -17); the cistern at -25 5 (floor 4 m under the sea); the aqueduct from
# -14 -14 to 12 22 (deck 18 m, the valve tower at -1.7 3.0); the sluice house x 11..17, z -12.5..-3.5 (4 m, door south);
# the watch house x 19..25, z 27.5..36.5; the treasury x 26.5..35.5, z 11..17 (door west at z 20..23); the castellum at 12 22.
island The Aqueduct
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Water to the City
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 91 22 h=3
walk 90 22 to 81 22 h=2.6
zone citygate
expect step 1
at 78 24 h=4
walk 78 24 to 55 38 h=9
walk 55 38 to 38 30 h=16
walk 38 30 to 26 26 h=16
read The water-master's decree
expect step 2
at -55 -5 h=4
walk -55 -5 to -30 -28 h=13.6
walk -30 -28 to -23 -17 h=18
walk -23 -17 to -13 -15.5 to -18 -15.5 h=18.05
zone source
expect step 3
open Water-master's box
expect story valvekey 1
expect step 4
use valve2
expect message won't budge
use valve1
expect story tally 1
expect step 6
at -25 5 h=1
zone cistern
expect step 6
use valve2
expect story tally 2
expect step 7
at -6.98 -4.27 h=19.5
zone arches
expect message screechers
kill Screecher
expect step 8
use valve3
expect story tally 3
expect step 9
at 12.5 -16 h=6
walk 12.5 -16 to 12.5 -8 h=4.05
zone sluice
use valve4
expect story tally 4
expect step 10
open Watch house chest
expect story castellumkey 1
expect step 11
use castellumdoor
expect message swings in
use valve5
expect story tally 5
expect step 12
expect shown fountain
zone fountain
expect step 13
wait 5
at 24 21.5 h=17
walk 24 21.5 to 29 21.5 h=16.05
zone treasury
expect step 14
open The city treasury
expect done
open Quay barrel
open Market stall box
open Sluice house box
open Sunk amphora
# the cistern wheels: middle, setting sun (west), rising sun (east)
use aqwheelC
expect message will not budge
use aqwheelB
use aqwheelA
use aqwheelC
expect shown aqcistern
open Cistern chest
